---
Fetch and cache FHIR packages

Usage: inkgen fetch [OPTIONS] --package <PACKAGE>

Options:
  -p, --package <PACKAGE>      Package name (e.g., hl7.fhir.r4.core)
  -v, --version <VERSION>      Package version (defaults to latest)
      --force                  Force re-download even if cached
      --verbose                Enable verbose logging
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>  Set log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error)
  -h, --help                   Print help
